p gates."}],"exports":[{"sids":["fs/proc/array.c::do_task_stat","fs/proc/task_mmu.c::task_vsize","fs/proc/task_nommu.c::task_vsize"],"text":"Stat emits pid, comm, state plus fixed fields; gated addrs use placeholders; ticks, nice, boot offset and low-bit signals applied; holds exec lock, drops mm, hides raw addrs. Vsize scales pages or sums areas under mmap lock."},{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::get_task_root","fs/proc/base.c::proc_cwd_link","fs/proc/base.c::proc_root_link","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_wchan","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_schedstat","fs/proc/base.c::lstats_show_proc","fs/proc/base.c::lstats_open","fs/proc/base.c::lstats_write","fs/proc/base.c::proc_lstats_operations","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_limits","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_syscall","fs/proc/base.c::proc_mem_open"],"text":"Cwd/root copy or missing. Wchan zero or symbolic under lock with perm gate. Schedstat triple, latency versioned slots with clear, limits headered rows, syscall number plus args, mem opener pins mm."},{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::task_dump_owner","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_evict_inode","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_make_inode","fs/proc/base.c::pid_getattr","fs/proc/base.c::pid_update_inode","fs/proc/base.c::pid_delete_dentry","fs/proc/base.c::proc_fill_cache"],"text":"Ownership root for kthreads else creds with fallbacks under RCU. Eviction detaches dirs under spinlock. Creation sets ino, ops, pid and security. Getattr hides invisible, update clears set-id, delete reclaims dead, fill emits best-effort."},{"sids":["fs/seq_file.c::seq_hlist_start_rcu","fs/seq_file.c::seq_hlist_next_rcu","fs/seq_file.c::__seq_open_private"],"text":"RCU hlist start returns node at offset or null; next advances position and follows link or restarts from head. Private open allocates zeroed context, binds on success and cleans on failure."}],"extracts":["1bb731ff07571de5e6f331c8ee9e6af8a05fe13d25623880e5052d0adcd42771","346ff1a95ce20c9ecec9d949d16ef7de488dfd2c0713c18d9d4902ecb8db2f63","e95cfd18722bc9391273123cf6ce1006cc06a