elative. Environ and auxv serve bounded ranges."},{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::oom_adj_read","fs/proc/base.c::__set_oom_adj","fs/proc/base.c::oom_adj_write","fs/proc/base.c::oom_score_adj_write","fs/proc/base.c::oom_score_adj_read","fs/proc/base.c::proc_oom_adj_operations","fs/proc/base.c::proc_oom_score_adj_operations","fs/proc/base.c::proc_loginuid_read","fs/proc/base.c::proc_sessionid_read","fs/proc/base.c::proc_loginuid_write","fs/proc/base.c::proc_fault_inject_read","fs/proc/base.c::proc_fault_inject_write","fs/proc/base.c::proc_fail_nth_read","fs/proc/base.c::proc_fail_nth_write"],"text":"OOM read scales, setter uses mutex plus RCU walk with privilege handling; writes validate and delegate. Login and session map audit ids with strict checks. Fault flag gated, fail ordinal plain."},{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::proc_exe_link","fs/proc/base.c::call_proc_get_link","fs/proc/internal.h::PDE","fs/proc/inode.c::use_pde","fs/proc/inode.c::proc_get_link","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_get_link","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_readlink","fs/proc/base.c::do_proc_readlink","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_make_base_inode","fs/proc/base.c::pid_revalidate","fs/proc/base.c::proc_inode_is_dead","fs/proc/internal.h::proc_splice_unmountable"],"text":"Exe and task links resolve under killable lock with absence and denial propagation. PDE, use and generic link manage entries. Readlink stages bounded. Base registers tracker; revalidate, liveness and splice handle retention."},{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::dname_to_vma_addr","fs/proc/base.c::map_files_d_revalidate","fs/proc/base.c::map_files_get_link","fs/proc/base.c::proc_map_files_get_link","fs/proc/base.c::proc_map_files_instantiate","fs/proc/base.c::proc_map_files_lookup","fs/proc/base.c::show_timer","fs/proc/base.c::proc_timers_open"],"text":"Range names strict hex pair. Map revalidate and link require exact file-backed mapping under mmap lock with ownership refresh; follow needs restore cap; instantiate and lookup derive perms and size. Timers show entries under lock; open stores pid and ns."}],"locks":[{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::lock_trace","fs/proc/base.c::unlock_trace","fs/proc/array.c::do_task_stat","fs/proc/task_nommu.c::task_vsize","fs/proc/base.c::map_files_d_revalidate","fs/proc/base.c::show_timer","fs/proc/base.c::proc_pid_evict_inode","fs/proc/base.c::__set_oom_adj"],"text":"Tracing uses killable exec read lock with perm check. Stat and wchan hold exec lock; sizing and maps hold mmap lock; pid list uses spinlock; OOM uses mutex plus RCU; ownership and timers use RCU plus timer lock."}],"pass":1,"phase_map":[{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p14","crown":"A","phase":"F0"},{"anchor":"HB-KPAPER-001/hb-s5.p10","crown":"A","phase":"F5"}],"schema":"lx.dossier.v1","state_machines":[{"sids":["fs/proc/array.c::children_seq_start","fs/proc/array.c::children_seq_next","fs/proc/array.c::children_seq_stop","fs/proc/array.c::children_seq_show","fs/proc/base.c::timers_start","fs/proc/base.c::timers_next","fs/proc/base.c::timers_stop","fs/proc/base.c::proc_timers_seq_ops"],"text":"Children iterate by position with ref handover and show ids; timers grab task under RCU, walk by pos and release."},{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::mem_rw","fs/proc/base.c::mem_read","fs/proc/base.c::mem_write","fs/proc/base.c::proc_map_files_readdir","fs/proc/base.c::timens_offsets_write"],"text":"Remote transfer pages via staging with fault mapping and pos update. Map readdir snapshots under lock then emits hex names; offset write validates two clock lines then applies."}],"structs":[{"sids":["fs/proc/base.c::pid_entry","fs/proc/base.c::NOD","fs/proc/base.c::DIR","fs/proc/base.c::LNK","fs/proc/base.c::REG","fs/proc/base.c::ONE","fs/proc/base.c::ATTR","fs/proc/base.c::proc_def_inode_operations","fs/proc/base.c::limit_names","fs/proc/base.c::lnames","fs/proc/base.c::map_files_info","fs/proc/base.c::timers_private"],"text":"Dir entries carry name, len, mode, ops and union with helpers for dir, link, regular, single and attr; default ops reject mode change